Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:20.10,纯中文,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《致命弯道2：死路》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:50.33,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:52.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要死在外面了 我恨死你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dead out here, and I'm hating you about now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:55.30,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你算哪门子经纪人? 你会找到那条路的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of agent are you? You'll fnd the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.37,0:02:58.30,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Kimberly 洛杉机这边才凌晨四点 你还让不让人睡?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kimberly, look, it's 4:00 a.m. in L.A. Can I go back to sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:03:02.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还骗我说是头等舱 害我整晚没合眼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was up all night on the red-eye, and it wasn't frst class like you promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:06.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好歹也给你弄了台好车吧? 好啦好啦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me credit for the car. Nice ride, huh? Yeah, whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.91,0:03:10.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 这些指示图很烂 这个节目也烂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, these directions suck. This project sucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:14.29,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,K 这是一次难得的机会 这不过是真人秀节目的首播{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}K., it's a great opportunity. It's a reality show pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.35,0:03:17.69,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打上次上镜以来 你就高歌猛进至前七{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sang your way to the top seven the last time you were on TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:20.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在是明星了 你是强大的Kimberly Caldwell{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're the star. You're Kimberly fucking-Caldwell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.89,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是他们手上唯一的明星{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only celebrity they've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:26.30,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要真那么大牌 Tommy 你就给我签部电影回来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'm such a celebrity, Tommy, get me a movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.37,0:03:30.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"Kimster" 你将因此而人气飚升 你将有机会赢得九万元奖金{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}''Kimster'', your Q score's gonna go way up, and you'll have a chance to win 90 grand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:34.10,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是十万吗? 我提成10% 不记得了?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was a hundred. Well, I get 10%, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:38.13,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 有个岔路口{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. There's a turnoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.65,0:03:46.71,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我睡前差不多练了两小时力量瑜珈 累死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I've got power yoga in, like, two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:50.02,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没找到吗? 我不知道 有间老造纸厂在这{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you fnd it yet? I don't know. There's some old paper mill here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.09,0:03:52.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但地图上没写 没错 那就对了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's nothin' about it on the map. Yeah. That's gotta be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.93,0:03:56.89,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Kimbo 你绝对不能走错 你没时间了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, ''Kimbo,'' you can't afford to make a wrong turn here. You really don't have the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:15.07,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要来这里? 因为这一行竞争激烈{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am I here? 'Cause this business is tough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:17.45,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你信号不好 我所有的委托人中 惟独你…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're breaking up. Of all my clients,you're the one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:21.01,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂? 喂? 有这种…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Hello? with the factor here-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.09,0:04:25.05,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,操{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:49.18,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊天啊天啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. Oh, my God. Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:59.55,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要死 不要死啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be dead. Don't be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:23.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命 救命啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:28.31,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:30.41,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:38.66,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 我会找人来救你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. I'm gonna get you help, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:44.27,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 求你 不要死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No, please! Please! No, don't die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:47.31,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作 呼吸 呼吸{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Breathe! Breathe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:06:00.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里 我在这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here. I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:29.71,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界末日来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the end of the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:34.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社会动荡 政府不再控制局面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}society in chaos, governments no longer in control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:40.35,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾害肆虐 世界千疮百孔 而你仍然存活于世{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world has been devastated by a catastrophic disaster, but you're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:45.95,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一夜之间 你被抛回蛮荒时代{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overnight, you've been thrust back into the Stone Age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:48.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现代社会的便利已为过去式{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Modern conveniences are a thing of the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.95,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有求存的勇气吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you have the guts to survive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:53.90,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是退伍海军上校Dale Murphy{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am retired Marine Colonel Dale Murphy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:55.99,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到"末日启示录"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to The Apocalypse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.07,0:07:59.10,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在接下来的五天里 六位参赛者…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over the next fve days, these six contestants...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:01.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将接受终极考验{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be put to the ultimate test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.71,0:08:03.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将会是最终的生还者…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna be the ultimate survivor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:07.90,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为上次节目让我明白 不计一切取胜才是王道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because on my last show I learned more than anything what it takes to win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:10.18,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这纹身代表什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's the tattoo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.25,0:08:14.45,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它象征"永恒" 因为我要被载入史册{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the ''infnity'' sign, because I wanna be remembered forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:17.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都叫我"Jonesy"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends call me ''Jonesy''...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:20.02,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但"无所畏惧"是我的另一个名字{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but ''Fearless'' is my middle name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:25.29,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是错误示范 兄弟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow! That sucked, dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:29.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是叫你修补跑道吗 可以重来吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to shave that ride. Can we do that again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:31.30,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家好 我是Elena{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. I'm Elena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:34.81,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就像狐狸 性感 狡猾…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm like a fox sexy, sleek...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:37.28,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我总能得到自己想要的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I always get what I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:39.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nina 我是个幸存者…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nina. I'm a survivor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:44.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我知道只有一个人靠得住那就是自己{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I know there's only one person I can count on myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:47.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是Jake 肌腱套上的三次手术…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Jake. Three surgeries on my rotator cuff...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.85,0:08:50.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使我和职业橄榄球生涯擦肩而过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}destroyed my shot at a pro football career-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.39,0:08:52.42,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这不能阻止我夺魁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not my drive to win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:57.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Amber 在伊拉克服役一期 他们称我为"征服者"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amber. One tour of duty in Iraq. They call me ''La Conquistadora. ''{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.07,0:09:02.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话少说 誓死效忠{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough said. Semper fi,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:05.83,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六名参赛者将被一同流放至荒野{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These six contestants have been thrown together in a devastated wasteland...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.91,0:09:09.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随身物品只有身上的衣服 还有求生欲望{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with only the clothes on their backs...and the will to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.91,0:09:14.54,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论晴空万里还是雷雨大作 五天内只有一人留下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rain or shine, in fve days, only one will remain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:17.98,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到"末日启示录"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to The Apocalypse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:28.19,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看怎么样?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do you think, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:31.25,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们花了一整晚剪辑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We spent all last night cutting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:35.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Brando 还是你行 你才居功至伟 Dale{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brando, eat your heart out. You're the real deal, Dale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.27,0:09:37.26,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是行内人喜欢你的原因{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why the network loves you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:39.93,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了 M 还用你说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It rocks, M Damn straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:42.30,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,节目一定能做下去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're goin' to series for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:50.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下地狱的好日子 制片人哪去了?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! Today's a good day to die. Where's my producer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:52.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太妙了 Michael 我说真的 过奖{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's brilliant, Michael. Really. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:59.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是觉得这和别的 生存节目没什么不同{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still don't see what makes this show any different from that other survivor show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:02.09,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不看电视{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't watch television.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:05.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是发生在世界末日的 这就是不同{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's supposed to take place at the end of the world. That's what makes it different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.63,0:10:08.12,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是来什么避暑圣地 结识朋友的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not on some summer resort trying to make alliances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.20,0:10:10.97,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的目标 是在"末日启示录"中笑到最后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're trying to be the last man standing after the apocalypse.{\r}
