Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:22.71,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,核污染已为事实{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Radiation poisoning is a reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:25.22,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们身上要戴着这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you're all wearing these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:29.58,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天每人会得到一张辐射消除卡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day,you'll be given a radiation elimination card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:32.35,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而当中的一张是带有辐射的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one of them is already contaminated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:37.73,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了晚上持有该卡的选手将出局{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the end of the day, the player holding the simulated radiated card is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:41.29,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 这只是说明你不及格{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. It just means you're disqualified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.37,0:15:46.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你有机会通过把卡 转移给他人而复活{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you have a chance to survive the day by giving your card to another player...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.31,0:15:49.93,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并成功消除辐射{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and surviving the radiation elimination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.01,0:15:55.11,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是对意志力 忍耐力 和运气的考验{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a test of your personal will, your endurance and fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:16:00.28,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在"末日" 你的命运可以像这样改变{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in The Apocalypse, your fate can change like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:05.29,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,野生动物 细菌感染 后末日狂热{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wild animals, bacterial infection and post-apocalyptic crazies...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:09.26,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都在你身边虎视耽耽{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are all around you, waiting to take you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:13.46,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们能被这个…监测到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're represented...by these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.53,0:16:16.59,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们称它为"命运的扭曲"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We call them ''Twists'' of Fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.67,0:16:19.47,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们是生存挑战 多多少少的…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are survival challenges, and dozens of them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.54,0:16:22.41,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散布在比赛区域{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are scattered all over the playing area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:25.81,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是触发了传感器 就会听到…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You trigger the motion sensor, and you hear this-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:34.94,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背面的信息阐述了你们的挑战内容{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lnstructions on the back explain your survival challenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:38.29,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完成挑战 你就…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accomplish the challenge, and you earn the right...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:42.42,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可取得辐射卡并交给你选择的选手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to take your radiated card and give it to any player you choose...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:45.33,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并安全度过今天{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and automatically survive the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:53.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下午六点此处集合 谁被淘汰到时分晓{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are going to assemble back here at 1800 hours and see who will perish in the chaos...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:57.94,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看谁离十万奖金更进一步{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and who is one step closer to $100,000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:00.98,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们好运 切记…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck to all of you. Remember-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.05,0:17:05.61,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,团队精神是生还的关键{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to work as a team to survive the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.68,0:17:08.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但只有一人…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But only one of you can be the ultimate survivalist...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.69,0:17:11.49,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能在"末日"之后生还{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after the apocalypse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:14.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停 漂亮 Dale 好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And cut! Nice work, Dale. All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.79,0:17:17.99,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好吊足观众的胃口了 大导演{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready for my 15 minutes, Hollywood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:20.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 大家{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:26.13,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,音频视频正通过耳机传送回编辑部{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, the headsets are transmitting audio and video back to the edit bay, so-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.21,0:17:28.54,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以先别摘下来 还有…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So don't take them off. And, also, uh-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:30.97,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手机和PDA等等都交给Neil{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cell phones and P.D.A.'s, etcetera give 'em to Neil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:33.10,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会把他们放进卡车里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna put them in the R.V.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.15,0:17:41.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩开心点 我去撒泡尿了 去吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have fun. I got to go take a wicked piss, mate. Mm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.75,0:17:44.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按原计划我会先跟着Elena和Jake{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'm gonna follow Elena and Jake frst, as planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:48.55,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家记住要真实展现{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,just remember, everybody Let's make it feel real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:50.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:55.19,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 怎么了? 我肯定会出丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. What's up? I'm so gonna suck at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:17:57.39,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当初为什么会听你的?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd I let you talk me into it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.47,0:17:59.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我魅力无法挡?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm, because I'm irresistible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:03.27,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个大坏蛋 走了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a jerk, you know? Gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:09.71,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上校 要是消除辐射的环节 输了会怎样?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel...What happens if we lose the elimination round?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:13.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会回旅行车里 到我和Jack Daniel这黯自伤心…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go back to the R.V., and you drown your sorrows with me and Jack Daniel's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:15.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直至比赛结束 听起来很有意思{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until the game is done. Oh, that sounds like fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.85,0:18:18.05,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但别担心 甜心 我会罩着你的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't worry, sweetness. I won't let you lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:21.22,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有该死的猪头山里人敢乱来 我会保护你的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if any of those pig-fuckin' hillbillies come around, I got your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:23.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 蠢货 我就是在这附近长大的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, bonehead! I grew up two counties from here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:26.22,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还从没跟猪上过床{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never had sex with a pig in my life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:28.39,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是歧视乡下人吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not promotin' stereotypes, are you, son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:30.77,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放机灵点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outstanding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:34.86,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的人脾气也许没我那么好 管好你的臭嘴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People in these parts might not take that talk too well! You might wanna put a lid on it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.94,0:18:37.81,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没问题 "星爷"? 没…没问题{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that all right with you, funnyman? Ye-Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.55,0:18:44.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够…够酷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh Th-Th-That's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:47.12,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们之间有那种"军人情结"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys got the whole ''military bond'' thing happenin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.19,0:18:49.28,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誓死效忠之类的废话 没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Semper fi and shit. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:51.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们都讨厌人渣{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we both hate assholes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:19:00.89,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠技师临走前该把这些都安置好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. The techies were supposed to fnish setting these up before they left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:03.59,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丢掉制片人的身份 专心投入比赛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your producer hat away and get your head in the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:06.26,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些交给我 正好我闲着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll set these up. I got time to kill anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.34,0:19:09.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 我也不想操这个心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. God, I wish I didn't have to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:11.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小Mikey真把你给拉下水了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old Mikey really put you on the spot, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:15.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜他是觉得把一个城市女孩 丢进大森林里会很有噱头{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess he thinks it'll be entertaining to send a city girl into the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:18.07,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒觉得很残酷 但别担心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cruel if you ask me, but don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.15,0:19:20.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上有些特质他没有发现 而我发现了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something in you he doesn't see that I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.59,0:19:23.11,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也许很漂亮 但你比你想象中更坚强{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may be pretty, but you're tougher than you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.19,0:19:25.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会没事的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:31.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"Neen"我们该往哪…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, ''Neen,'' which way should we-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.03,0:19:34.09,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来该往那走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we go that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.23,0:20:43.39,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是吃鱼 也许该往河边走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you eat fish, maybe we should head towards the river to find some food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.47,0:20:46.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吃素的 我不吃不用任何动物产品{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm vegan. I don't eat or use any animal products...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:48.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包括水里游的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including the swimming kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:52.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你的裤带 似乎是皮制的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Isn't your beIt made of leather?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:54.95,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是仿皮 我不是伪君子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pleather. I'm not a hypocrite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.01,0:20:58.28,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不是这意思{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I didn't think that you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.35,0:21:00.91,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正因为你是素食主义者 才会被挑来上节目{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being vegan is why you got picked to be on the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:03.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,M 觉得对你来说这外面没什么可吃{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M. thought there wouldn't be a lot for you to eat out here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:07.22,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说不定得被迫吃幼虫撑肚子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you might have to resort to gulping down insect larva or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:11.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国人看真人秀不就是 喜欢这些恶心东西吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the kind of thing America loves in its reality shows, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:15.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国很变态 不假{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}America's sick. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:20.23,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌真人秀 都是些弱智节目{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate reality shows. They're pretty idiotic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.31,0:21:24.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么要做? 本职工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why are you doing this? Because it's my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:27.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是M的第一个企划 我需要表示下支持{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's M's frst project, and I'm just trying to be supportive.{\r}
