Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.45,0:53:20.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 听着 冷静点 他们会找到我们的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look. Calm down. They'll fnd us here!{\r}
