Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.23,0:53:28.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些山里的怪物 他们把Mara杀了…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These hillbilly freaks! They killed Mara...{\r}
