Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.53,0:53:33.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得离开这里 马上…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get out ofhere right now..{\r}
