Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.88,0:53:42.90,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说真的 得了 这也是游戏的一部分{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not kidding! Come on. It's part of the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.98,0:53:47.14,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后末日疯子在树林里晃荡 这不是游戏 好吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Post-apocalyptic crazies roaming through the forest. It's not a game, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.22,0:53:49.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些山里人吃了她的手指{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These hillbillies were eating her fnger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.42,0:53:52.18,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山里人吃人 M 真是个天才{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hillbilly cannibals. M is a genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.25,0:53:55.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要笑了 不要笑了 老兄 好吗? 别笑了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop laughing! Yo, stop laughing, man, okay? Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.83,0:53:59.23,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是Mara 她是M的女朋友 她是剧情安排的一部分 我明白{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Mara. She's M's girlfriend. She was in on it. I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.30,0:54:03.06,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到的是特效{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you saw was special effects.{\r}
