Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.10,0:54:09.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得马上离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get out of here now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.94,0:54:12.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你了 好 好 好 我们走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Yeah. Yeah, yeah. We're going.{\r}
