Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.94,0:54:17.38,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种片子总是对手之间相互吓唬{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These kind of shows always screw with their contestants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.45,0:54:21.01,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要走就走吧 我要留下来 赢那十万美金{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys wanna go, go ahead. I'm stayin' put and winnin' the hundred G's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.08,0:54:23.21,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也会杀了你的 老兄{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then they'll kill you too, man.{\r}
