Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.53,0:54:38.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈的…那…那是Kimberly的纹身{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the fuck That-That's Kimberly's tattoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.63,0:54:40.90,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的 那是她的腿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit. That's her leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.34,0:54:48.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 游戏结束了 Amber 我们走吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Game's over. Amber, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.71,0:54:50.74,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
