Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.89,0:55:04.55,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是吃人族 老兄 住嘴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're fucking cannibals, dude. Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.63,0:55:06.79,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,旅行车究竟在哪里? 就在山脊那边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell's the R.V.? Just over the ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.86,0:55:09.33,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要说话 赶路吧 我在赶呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep quiet and keep moving. I ain't stoppin'.{\r}
