Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.65,0:55:32.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 把护腕给我 不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Give me your wristband. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.92,0:55:36.15,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 不要再遮遮掩掩了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you don't have to hide anymore.{\r}
