Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.99,0:55:43.09,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我发现我再也不能打橄榄球时 我也干过同样的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I found out I'd never play football again, I spiraled down pretty hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.17,0:55:47.12,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生让我参加她的自杀病人小组{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My therapist told me I should sit in one of her suicide support groups.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.20,0:55:49.76,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了让我对人生有个更好的认识{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, give me a better perspective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.84,0:55:54.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾有个女孩也跟你这样 只是她用的是大手帕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a girl that used to do the same thing, only she used a bandana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.51,0:55:58.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这疤什么时候有的? 六个月前{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how old is the scar? About six months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.88,0:56:00.51,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.58,0:56:03.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我一生中…我相信了太多的坏人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just trusted too many of the wrong people...all my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.59,0:56:06.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我现在挺过来了 那这是旧事重提了?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm past it now. So it's old news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.89,0:56:11.05,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我来赢那笔钱是为了什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think I came to win this game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.13,0:56:14.79,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,估计你会有机会得到那笔钱的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess you'll get your chance to do just that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.40,0:56:53.93,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要敢放个屁 老东西 我就崩了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You so much as fart, old man, and I'll drop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.84,0:56:59.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要杀我 老兄 我是虔诚的基督教徒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't kill me, brother. I'm a good Christian man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.98,0:57:04.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的 你确定是这里? 是啊就是这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. Are you sure? Yeah. This was the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.25,0:57:07.01,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有轮胎印空的设备箱 还有垃圾{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here are the tire tracks, the empty equipment cases, the garbage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.08,0:57:09.71,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈祸不单行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is so f'ed in the A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.79,0:57:12.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的旅行车不见了 那我们继续走吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fucking R.V. is gone! Let's just keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.82,0:57:15.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们死定了 去哪? 最近的小镇也在50英里以外{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're dead meat. Where to? The nearest town is 50 miles away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.79,0:57:18.12,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们最终会被山里人拿来做烧烤的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all gonna end up hillbilly barbecue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.19,0:57:21.06,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次警告 保持安静 走吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna tell you again. Keep quiet! Just come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.13,0:57:24.22,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主干道旁有个老造纸厂 已经废弃了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's that old paper mill out by the main road. It's abandoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.30,0:57:26.79,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得找个地方躲起来 也许那会有个公用电话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta dig in somewhere. Maybe there's a public phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.87,0:57:30.53,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么说是废弃的吗? 是因为里面什么也没有 包括电话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, you know why they call it abandoned? 'Cause there's nothing in it, including phones!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.61,0:57:34.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 不要伤害我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Don't hurt me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.31,0:57:37.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是捕熊夹 这里没有动物{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a bear trap. There's no animaIs around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.45,0:57:40.57,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么要放个捕熊夹?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do they have a fucking bear trap set?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.65,0:57:44.42,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是要捉熊 是捉人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not trapping bears. They're trapping people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.49,0:57:48.65,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有野味吃 他们就吃我们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no wildlife to eat around here. They're eating us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.72,0:57:52.46,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我错了 去纸浆厂是个好主意 我们赶紧离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I was wrong. Paper mill's a great idea. Let's just get outta here.{\r}
