Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.80,0:57:58.67,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我希望大家一起行动 当心脚下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I want everyone to stick together and watch where you step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.73,0:58:01.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, no shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.17,0:58:05.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.53,0:58:33.43,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你炸了谁 老家伙?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you blowin' up, old-timer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.50,0:58:36.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是鳟鱼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,just the trout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.41,0:58:39.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这样 他们才会浮到水面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only way to bring 'em to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.71,0:58:42.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸药把它们震昏{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dynamite stuns 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.91,0:58:46.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后它们就像睡莲一样浮上来 我再捞出来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then they float like lily pads, and I just scoop 'em up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.42,0:58:54.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你老婆很美{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.69,0:58:59.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 那是我的黛利拉 她给了今生我最美好的时光{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's my Delilah. Gave me the happiest days of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.90,0:59:02.63,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝保佑她{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God bless her soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.70,0:59:06.00,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这幸运的混蛋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you one lucky son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.07,0:59:10.63,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多人进了树林 就没见他们出来过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lotta folk go in them woods. Never seen one come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.71,0:59:13.54,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都没有和他们有过接触{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l stay clear of them myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.61,0:59:16.54,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有多少这样的怪胎?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many of those freaks are out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.61,0:59:21.35,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚 比你碰到的多 这是肯定的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard to know. More than the ones you run across. That's for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.42,0:59:23.65,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.72,0:59:27.42,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 其实跟你我都一样 只是丑一点…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,just like you and me, brother, 'cept uglier...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.49,0:59:29.51,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更强壮一点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a lot stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.59,0:59:33.36,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我曾经开车撞到他们的一个小孩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I hit one of them young'uns once in my pickup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.43,0:59:36.69,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他马上跳起来 然后继续前行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He popped up and just kept goin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.77,0:59:39.93,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是化学物质让他们发生了变异{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the chemicaIs changed 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.00,0:59:44.23,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纸浆厂约30年前关闭了…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pulp mill shut down near 30 years ago...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.31,0:59:46.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留下一片狼藉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and left a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.68,0:59:49.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有野兽都因毒物而灭绝了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the poison killed off all the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.51,0:59:53.41,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这附近的居民大部分都搬走了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most folks 'round these parts left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.48,0:59:58.61,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一户人家留了下来…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one family that stayed on in this holler...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.69,1:00:03.59,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不久 妈妈生了很多宝宝…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pretty soon their babies started gushin' out of their mama's womb...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.66,1:00:07.43,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我放外面的鳟鱼一样丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just as ugly as them trout I got hangin' out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.27,1:00:14.50,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝们长大了 有了自己的孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then they grow up, have kids of their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.94,1:00:18.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果生出来的孩子更丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turned out even worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.38,1:00:22.94,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要留下来吃点鱼吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna stay for a bite?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.01,1:00:26.57,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鱼很难看 但煎起来很好吃{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fish is ugly, but they fry up real good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.65,1:00:30.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 非常感谢 但我得走了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Much obliged, but I gotta get goin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.52,1:00:37.79,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 如果你要去救你朋友 去算账…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you're gonna head out to get your friends, settle the score...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.86,1:00:40.89,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好天黑前出来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}best jump to it before it gets dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.96,1:00:43.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不会想晚上呆在树林里的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna be out in them woods at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.03,1:00:46.09,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要留下来 老人家?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you stay, old-timer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.17,1:00:50.00,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永远都不能离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I could never leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.37,1:00:54.83,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得跟我孩子在一起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta stay close to my young'uns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.91,1:00:57.74,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,操你妈的…我要杀了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You motherfucker...l gonna kill you, man..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.81,1:01:00.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了我的孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed my boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.85,1:01:04.18,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.25,1:01:07.19,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你…我要杀了你 混蛋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you...I'll kill you, motherfucker..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.26,1:01:09.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.86,1:01:13.49,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,操你妈的 我肯定要杀了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Motherfucker! I'm sure 'nough gonna kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.66,1:01:20.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要抓到你…我要教你怎么跟我的孩子打交道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you...I'll teach you to mess with my kids..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.91,1:01:32.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代我向尊夫人问好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say hello to the missus for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.75,1:02:14.59,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是他们其中一个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.80,1:02:22.66,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是Elena 是吗? 为什么这么认为?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Elena. Yeah? What makes you think that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.17,1:02:28.10,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.31,1:02:33.74,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开她{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.18,1:02:40.11,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天哪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.18,1:02:42.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nina 等等{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nina, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.32,1:02:46.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.52,1:03:20.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑…快跑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on...Come on..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.08,1:03:44.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.19,1:03:58.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.03,1:04:02.93,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nina在哪? 她丢下我们跑了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Nina? She deserted us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.71,1:04:18.58,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋 继续赶路{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch! Just keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.58,1:04:22.81,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我们分头行动 我去找Nina{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, split up. I'll fnd Nina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.88,1:04:24.94,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在造纸厂碰头 走 好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll meet up at the mill. Go! Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.87,1:04:40.99,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nina 救命…救命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nina! Help me...Help me..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.07,1:04:43.09,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nina? 救命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nina? Help me..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.32,1:05:00.65,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nina? 我…在洞里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nina? I'm...down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.72,1:05:03.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Nina? 你没事吧?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nina? Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.83,1:05:06.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得救你出来 好吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get you out of there, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.23,1:05:10.10,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 抓着我的手 抓着 Nina{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, come on. Come on, Nina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.17,1:05:12.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我够不到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.47,1:05:14.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓着我的手 Nina{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Nina!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.94,1:05:16.93,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快够到了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.01,1:05:20.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 坚持住{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.94,1:05:23.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我抓到你了 我抓到你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got you now. I've got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.79,1:05:32.25,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍微往右一点…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try a little right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.76,1:05:41.73,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.80,1:05:47.03,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的肩膀 脱臼了 你得帮我接上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my shoulder. It's dislocated. You gotta help me pop it in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.10,1:05:51.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊不 Nina 轻点儿 好了 拉一下再扭一下 明白吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, no, Nina! Easy! Okay, pull and twist, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.94,1:05:55.31,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.38,1:05:58.54,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扶我起来 Nina{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me up. Nina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.61,1:06:00.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像去打仗一样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like going to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.68,1:06:04.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Amber,Jonesy 都没事吗? 我们都没事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amber,Jonesy Did they make it? We all made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.69,1:06:07.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去造纸厂跟他们会合 好吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll meet up with them at the mill, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.86,1:06:10.15,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 走吧 走了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Let's go. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.30,1:06:17.39,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 Nina{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Nina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.92,1:06:43.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 去哪?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.70,1:06:54.23,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死 该死 该死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Shit! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.73,1:07:26.90,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你刚才狠狠教训了他们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You-You totally kicked ass back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.97,1:07:30.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说真的 你就像战士公主西娜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm serious. You were, like, Xena, Warrior Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.41,1:07:33.07,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对 我以前就是个彻彻底底的混蛋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right. I was a total asshole before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.14,1:07:36.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不会贬低你或其他女人了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm never gonna dis you or any other female ever again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.45,1:07:39.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好 太棒了 我们甩掉他们了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. It's cool. We outran 'em.{\r}
